<%# Visual authority: Kurukoo public composition — warm canvas, evidence-led feature pathways, Space Grotesk headings, and terracotta only for meaningful continuation. %>
<%- include('_partials/head', { pageStyles: ['/css/kurukoo-public-pages.css?v=8'] }) %>
<%- include('_partials/nav') %>
<main class="public-composition public-composition--features container" aria-labelledby="features-title">
  <section class="public-feature-hero">
    <div class="public-feature-hero__copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">Kurukoo features</span>
      <h1 id="features-title">One conversation can become a clear next step.</h1>
      <p>Kurukoo keeps understanding, discovery, requests, follow-through and supported coordination connected to the same conversation rather than scattering them across disconnected tools.</p>
      <div class="public-feature-hero__actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/chat">Start in Web Chat</a>
        <a class="public-return-link" href="/how-it-works">See the request lifecycle</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="public-feature-lifecycle" aria-labelledby="feature-lifecycle-title">
      <span class="eyebrow">Continuity, not automation theatre</span>
      <h2 id="feature-lifecycle-title">Every meaningful action retains its boundary.</h2>
      <ol>
        <li><span>01</span><div><strong>Understand</strong><p>Start with the conversation and the context you choose to share.</p></div></li>
        <li><span>02</span><div><strong>Prepare</strong><p>Discovery and requests make the next option or decision explicit.</p></div></li>
        <li><span>03</span><div><strong>Act with evidence</strong><p>Payment, provider and delivery states stay separate until their evidence exists.</p></div></li>
      </ol>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <section class="public-feature-section" aria-labelledby="features-understand-title">
    <div class="public-feature-section__heading"><span class="eyebrow">01 · Understand &amp; organise</span><h2 id="features-understand-title">Keep the useful context close to the work.</h2><p>Conversation remains the return path while Desk, Memory, Tasks and Reminders give the relationship durable structure.</p></div>
    <div class="public-feature-grid">
      <article class="public-feature-card public-feature-card--featured"><svg class="k-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#chat"></use></svg><h3>Agent</h3><p>Talk naturally about what you need. Agent interprets context and asks when a request needs clarification.</p><a href="/chat">Open Web Chat <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
      <article class="public-feature-card"><svg class="k-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#settings"></use></svg><h3>Desk</h3><p>Your authenticated home for active work, attention, recent activity and continuity.</p><a href="/desk">Open Desk <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
      <article class="public-feature-card"><svg class="k-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#memory"></use></svg><h3>Memory</h3><p>Review and control the useful context you choose to keep connected to Kurukoo.</p><a href="/memory">Manage Memory <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
      <article class="public-feature-card"><svg class="k-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#tasks"></use></svg><h3>Tasks &amp; reminders</h3><p>Turn conversations into follow-through with clear ownership, timing and recovery.</p><a href="/tasks">Explore tasks <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="public-feature-section public-feature-section--split" aria-labelledby="features-coordinate-title">
    <div class="public-feature-section__heading"><span class="eyebrow">02 · Discover &amp; coordinate</span><h2 id="features-coordinate-title">Move from a question to a governed request.</h2><p>Discovery, Network, Requests and Connect each have a distinct role. None implies a live person, service or linked channel without the corresponding state.</p></div>
    <div class="public-feature-grid public-feature-grid--compact">
      <article class="public-feature-card"><svg class="k-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#discover"></use></svg><h3>Discover</h3><p>Find relevant people, places, services, products, topics and opportunities.</p><a href="/discover">Explore Discover <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
      <article class="public-feature-card"><svg class="k-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#package"></use></svg><h3>Requests</h3><p>Move from conversation to a request with an explicit lifecycle and evidence.</p><a href="/requests">Review Requests <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
      <article class="public-feature-card"><svg class="k-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#channels"></use></svg><h3>Network</h3><p>Explore people, providers, contributors, channels and capabilities without creating another identity.</p><a href="/network">Explore the network <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
      <article class="public-feature-card"><svg class="k-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons/kurukoo-icons.svg#channels"></use></svg><h3>Connect</h3><p>Bring user-owned channels, devices and services into the same Kurukoo relationship.</p><a href="/connect">Review connections <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="public-feature-boundary" aria-labelledby="feature-boundary-title">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">03 · Act with clear boundaries</span><h2 id="feature-boundary-title">Coordination is useful only when its state is known.</h2><p>Checkout, payment, provider matching, delivery, safety and agent actions each retain their own preparation, confirmation and recovery evidence.</p></div>
    <div class="public-feature-boundary__links"><a href="/agents"><strong>Agents</strong><span>Bounded goals with policy and evidence</span></a><a href="/safety"><strong>Safety</strong><span>Consent-bound context and trusted contacts</span></a><a href="/how-it-works"><strong>Request states</strong><span>See what changes before an action is confirmed</span></a></div>
  </section>
</main>
<%- include('_partials/footer') %>
